{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44426","headline":"诗三百三首 一二三 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一二三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云山叠叠连天碧，路僻林深无客游。\n远望孤蟾明皎皎，近闻羣鸟语啾啾。\n老夫独坐栖青嶂，少室闲居任白头。\n可叹往年与今日，无心还似水东流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}